<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Kiểm Tra & Ôn Đúng/Sai Vô Hạn Tin Học 12 - Chuẩn Bộ GD&ĐT 2026</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter & JetBrains Mono -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        cyber: {
                            50: '#f0f9ff',
                            100: '#e0f2fe',
                            400: '#38bdf8',
                            500: '#0ea5e9',
                            600: '#0284c7',
                            700: '#0369a1',
                            800: '#075985',
                            900: '#0c4a6e',
                            950: '#082f49',
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04); }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #0ea5e9; border-radius: 9999px; }
        .dark ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #0284c7; }

        .cyber-header-bg {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(at 0% 0%, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.22) 0px, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(at 100% 100%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.22) 0px, transparent 50%),
                linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 28px 28px, 28px 28px;
        }
        @keyframes pulse-fast {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.45; }
        }
        .timer-warning { animation: pulse-fast 1.2s infinite; }

        .correct-bold-answer {
            font-weight: 800 !important;
            color: #047857;
        }
        .dark .correct-bold-answer {
            color: #34d399;
        }
        .correct-bold-badge {
            font-weight: 800 !important;
            border-width: 2px !important;
            border-color: #10b981 !important;
            background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15) !important;
            color: #065f46 !important;
        }
        .dark .correct-bold-badge {
            color: #6ee7b7 !important;
        }
        .kw-pill {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 1px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.15);
            color: #0369a1;
            border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.35);
        }
        .dark .kw-pill {
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
            color: #7dd3fc;
            border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);
        }
        .trap-pill {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 1px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            background: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.15);
            color: #be123c;
            border: 1px solid rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.35);
            text-decoration: line-through;
        }
        .dark .trap-pill {
            background: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.15);
            color: #fda4af;
            border-color: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.35);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col transition-colors duration-200">

    <!-- STICKY HEADER -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 cyber-header-bg text-white shadow-lg border-b border-cyan-500/30">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <!-- Brand / Title -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-400 via-sky-500 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-lg shadow-md shadow-cyan-500/20 shrink-0">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <h1 class="font-bold text-sm sm:text-base tracking-tight text-white line-clamp-1">TIN HỌC 12 - ÔN ĐÚNG/SAI VÔ HẠN & MẸO TỪ KHÓA</h1>
                        <span class="hidden md:inline-block text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-400/30">SIÊU DỄ HIỂU</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 line-clamp-1">Tạo câu Đúng/Sai vô hạn • Mẹo bắt từ khóa 3 giây • Giải thích cho người mất gốc</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Active Exam Controls -->
            <div id="examHeaderControls" class="hidden items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
                <div class="hidden xl:flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium border border-white/10">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal text-cyan-400"></i>
                    <span>Đã làm: <strong id="headerProgressText" class="text-cyan-300 font-mono">0/28</strong></span>
                </div>

                <div id="timerContainer" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/80 border border-cyan-500/40 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-mono font-bold text-sm sm:text-base text-cyan-300 shadow-inner">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i>
                    <span id="timerDisplay">40:00</span>
                </div>

                <button onclick="toggleMobilePalette()" class="lg:hidden p-2 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white relative" title="Bảng câu hỏi">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-table-cells"></i>
                    <span id="mobileProgressBadge" class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 rounded-full">0</span>
                </button>

                <button onclick="confirmReshuffle()" class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium px-3 py-2 rounded-xl transition" title="Tạo đề mới đảo câu hỏi và đáp án">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shuffle text-cyan-300"></i>
                    <span class="hidden md:inline">Đảo đề mới</span>
                </button>

                <button id="headerSubmitBtn" onclick="openSubmitModal()" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-sky-500 hover:from-cyan-500 hover:to-sky-600 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl shadow-md transition transform active:scale-95">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i>
                    <span>Nộp bài</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Actions (Cheat Sheet, Binary Tool, Home, Theme) -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <!-- Cheat Sheet Button (Always Visible) -->
                <button onclick="toggleCheatSheetModal()" class="px-2.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 hover:bg-amber-500/30 border border-amber-400/40 text-amber-300 text-xs font-extrabold flex items-center gap-1.5 transition" title="Mẹo 8 Từ Khóa Bất Bại Chống Bẫy Đúng/Sai">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i>
                    <span class="hidden sm:inline">Mẹo 8 Từ Khóa</span>
                </button>

                <!-- IPv4 Binary Tool Button -->
                <button onclick="toggleBinaryTool()" class="p-2 sm:px-2.5 sm:py-2 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-cyan-200 text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1 transition" title="Công cụ đổi Nhị phân ↔ Thập phân (IPv4)">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-binary"></i>
                    <span class="hidden lg:inline font-mono">IP</span>
                </button>

                <button id="backToConfigBtn" onclick="confirmExitToSetup()" class="hidden items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl transition" title="Quay về màn hình chính">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i>
                    <span class="hidden sm:inline">Trang chính</span>
                </button>

                <button onclick="toggleDarkMode()" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-300 transition" title="Đổi giao diện Sáng/Tối">
                    <i id="themeIcon" class="fa-solid fa-moon"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN CONTENT CONTAINER -->
    <main class="flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 py-6">

        <!-- ================= VIEW 1: SETUP & CONFIGURATION SCREEN ================= -->
        <section id="setupScreen" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6">
            <!-- Hero Banner -->
            <div class="cyber-header-bg rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 text-white shadow-xl border border-cyan-500/30 relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
                    <div class="space-y-3 max-w-2xl">
                        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-400/30 text-amber-300 text-xs font-mono font-semibold">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> Đề Cương Giữa Kỳ 1 + Trình Tạo Đúng/Sai Vô Hạn
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Hệ Thống Luyện Thi & Chuyên Gia Trị Câu Đúng/Sai</h2>
                        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                            Không còn nỗi sợ học vẹt hay bị lừa khi đề thi đổi câu chữ! Hệ thống tích hợp <strong>Mẹo Bắt Cặp Từ Khóa 3 Giây</strong>, giải thích siêu bình dân cho người mất gốc và <strong>Trình Sinh Câu Hỏi Đúng/Sai Vô Hạn</strong> với hàng trăm bối cảnh mới.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 shrink-0">
                        <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs border border-cyan-400/20 rounded-2xl p-4 text-center">
                            <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-mono font-extrabold text-cyan-300">48+9</div>
                            <div class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1">Câu Gốc Đề Cương</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-amber-500/20 backdrop-blur-xs border border-amber-400/40 rounded-2xl p-4 text-center">
                            <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-mono font-extrabold text-amber-300">∞</div>
                            <div class="text-xs text-amber-100 mt-1">Đúng/Sai Vô Hạn</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- QUICK LAUNCH: INFINITE TRUE/FALSE MASTER WORKSPACE -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-900 via-purple-900 to-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 text-white shadow-xl border-2 border-amber-400/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="space-y-2">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-xs uppercase">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-fire"></i> Tính năng mới đặc biệt
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-white">Phòng Luyện Đúng/Sai Vô Hạn + Mẹo Từ Khóa Siêu Tốc</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-indigo-100 leading-relaxed">
                        Ôn riêng Phần II (Đúng/Sai) với chế độ chấm từng ý ngay lập tức, tự động gạch chân <strong>[Từ khóa Đúng]</strong> và <strong>[Từ khóa Bẫy Sai]</strong>, giải thích bằng ví dụ đời thường dễ hiểu nhất và bấm nút <strong>sinh ra vô hạn câu hỏi mới</strong> để thử thách khả năng nhận diện đề lạ!
                    </p>
                </div>
                <button type="button" onclick="openInfiniteTFTrainer()" class="shrink-0 w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-orange-500 hover:from-amber-500 hover:to-orange-600 text-slate-950 font-black text-sm sm:text-base shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/25 flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 transition transform active:scale-95">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-infinity text-lg"></i>
                    <span>VÀO ÔN ĐÚNG/SAI VÔ HẠN NGAY</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Configuration Card -->
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-5 sm:p-7 space-y-6">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-900 dark:text-cyan-400 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-3">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code text-cyan-500"></i> Hoặc Thiết Lập Đề Thi Tổng Hợp (Phần I + Phần II)
                </h3>

                <!-- 1. Exam Mode Selection -->
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">1. Chọn chế độ làm bài:</label>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3.5">
                        <!-- Mode 1: Standard MOET 2026 -->
                        <label id="modeCardStandard" onclick="selectExamMode('standard')" class="cursor-pointer rounded-2xl border-2 border-cyan-500 bg-cyan-50/50 dark:bg-cyan-950/20 p-4 transition flex flex-col justify-between gap-2">
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                                <input type="radio" name="examMode" value="standard" checked class="mt-1 accent-cyan-600 w-4 h-4">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap">
                                        <span>Đề Chuẩn Bộ (28 câu)</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                                        <strong>24 câu Phần I</strong> + <strong>4 câu Phần II</strong> (Có thể kèm câu sinh mới).
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </label>

                        <!-- Mode 2: Full Outline -->
                        <label id="modeCardFull" onclick="selectExamMode('full')" class="cursor-pointer rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-400 p-4 transition flex flex-col justify-between gap-2">
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                                <input type="radio" name="examMode" value="full" class="mt-1 accent-cyan-600 w-4 h-4">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm">Full Đề Cương (57 câu)</div>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                                        Làm toàn bộ <strong>48 câu Phần I</strong> + <strong>9 câu Phần II gốc</strong>.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </label>

                        <!-- Mode 3: Only Part II + Infinite -->
                        <label id="modeCardOnlyP2" onclick="selectExamMode('onlyp2')" class="cursor-pointer rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-400 p-4 transition flex flex-col justify-between gap-2">
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                                <input type="radio" name="examMode" value="onlyp2" class="mt-1 accent-cyan-600 w-4 h-4">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-sm">Chuyên Đúng/Sai (9 gốc + 6 mới)</div>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                                        Luyện <strong>15 câu Đúng/Sai</strong> (9 câu đề cương + 6 câu tự sinh mới).
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </label>

                        <!-- Mode 4: Custom -->
                        <label id="modeCardCustom" onclick="selectExamMode('custom')" class="cursor-pointer rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-400 p-4 transition flex flex-col justify-between gap-2">
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                                <input type="radio" name="examMode" value="custom" class="mt-1 accent-cyan-600 w-4 h-4">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm">Tùy Chỉnh Số Lượng</div>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                                        Tự chọn số câu Phần I, Phần II gốc và số câu Đúng/Sai sinh mới.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2. Topic Filter Selection -->
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">2. Chủ đề kiến thức:</label>
                        <button type="button" onclick="toggleAllTopics()" class="text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 hover:underline">
                            Chọn / Bỏ chọn tất cả
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                        <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 cursor-pointer hover:border-cyan-400 transition">
                            <input type="checkbox" value="AI" checked onchange="updateAvailableCounts()" class="topic-cb w-4 h-4 accent-cyan-600 rounded">
                            <div class="text-xs">
                                <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Chủ đề A: Trí tuệ nhân tạo (AI)</div>
                                <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">24 câu Phần I + Đúng/Sai AI sinh mới</div>
                            </div>
                        </label>
                        <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 cursor-pointer hover:border-cyan-400 transition">
                            <input type="checkbox" value="NET" checked onchange="updateAvailableCounts()" class="topic-cb w-4 h-4 accent-cyan-600 rounded">
                            <div class="text-xs">
                                <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Chủ đề B: Mạng máy tính & Internet</div>
                                <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">13 câu P1 • 9 câu P2 gốc + Vô hạn câu mới</div>
                            </div>
                        </label>
                        <label class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 cursor-pointer hover:border-cyan-400 transition">
                            <input type="checkbox" value="ETHICS" checked onchange="updateAvailableCounts()" class="topic-cb w-4 h-4 accent-cyan-600 rounded">
                            <div class="text-xs">
                                <div class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100">Chủ đề F: Văn hóa & Ứng xử số</div>
                                <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">11 câu Phần I + Đúng/Sai Ứng xử sinh mới</div>
                            </div>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Custom Question Count Controls -->
                <div id="customCountControls" class="hidden grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-50/50 dark:bg-slate-800/50 border border-cyan-200 dark:border-slate-700">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-semibold mb-1.5">
                            <span>Số câu Phần I (A,B,C,D):</span>
                            <span class="text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">Tối đa: <strong id="maxP1Label">48</strong></span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="number" id="customP1Input" min="0" max="48" value="24" class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-sm font-bold font-mono">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-semibold mb-1.5">
                            <span>Số câu Đúng/Sai Gốc:</span>
                            <span class="text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">Tối đa: <strong id="maxP2Label">9</strong></span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="number" id="customP2Input" min="0" max="9" value="9" class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-600 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-sm font-bold font-mono">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-semibold mb-1.5">
                            <span>Số câu Đúng/Sai Sinh Mới (∞):</span>
                            <span class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">Tự động tạo</span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="number" id="customInfiniteP2Input" min="0" max="100" value="5" class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-amber-400 dark:border-amber-600 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-sm font-bold font-mono">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 3. Time Limit & Study Options -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-2">
                    <div class="space-y-2.5">
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-clock text-cyan-500 mr-1"></i> 3. Thời gian làm bài (phút):
                        </label>
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
